  "description": "Craft a cozy Christmas village with this watercolour clipart bundle – filled with snowy houses, evergreen trees, bundled-up villagers, and steaming mugs of cocoa. Perfect for creating holiday cards, festive invitations, posters, markets, planner stickers, wall art, and more! Each element is painted in soft, muted tones of forest green, blush, and cream – capturing that small-town charm and peaceful winter magic.\nThis set includes 65+ high-quality PNG elements:\nCozy houses and shops decorated for the holidays\nSnow-covered trees and Christmas pines\nCute winter characters holding hot cocoa\nVehicles, mugs, and more.\nAll elements are high-resolution (300 DPI) with transparent backgrounds – ready to mix, match, and layer for your own winter wonderland scenes.",
